#ASSERT NOT `General Condition 5 — Bao Minh received notice within 14 days of the occurrence on` (YMD 2026 6 10) (`the Insured's conduct after an occurrence on 10 June 2026, notice received on 25 June`'s `the notice`)
#ASSERT NOT `General Condition 5 — Bao Minh received notice within 14 days of the occurrence on` (YMD 2026 6 10) (`the Insured's conduct after an occurrence on 10 June 2026, no notice`'s `the notice`)

-- The duty on the day clock: notice on day 14 is in time; nothing by day 15 is a breach.
#TRACE `General Condition 5 — the duty to notify an occurrence` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Insured` DOES `give notice of the occurrence that Bao Minh receives` AT 14
#TRACE `General Condition 5 — the duty to notify an occurrence` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 15)

-- Repairs after notice: Bao Minh inspects on day 3 and the Insured then repairs; or no
-- inspection within a 7-day reasonable period, and the Insured is free to repair.
#TRACE `General Condition 5 — the inspection before repair, within` 7 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Bao Minh` DOES `inspect the loss` AT 3
    PARTY `the Insured` DOES `repair or replace the damaged item` AT 5
#TRACE `General Condition 5 — the inspection before repair, within` 7 AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 8)
    PARTY `the Insured` DOES `repair or replace the damaged item` AT 9

-- Last paragraph: an item not repaired properly without delay after an earlier loss.
#ASSERT     `General Condition 5 — cover on the item had ceased because an earlier loss was not repaired properly without delay` `a loss to an item not repaired after an earlier loss`
#ASSERT NOT `General Condition 5 — cover on the item had ceased because an earlier loss was not repaired properly without delay` `the standard loss to the works`
#ASSERT NOT `Section I — the loss to the item is covered` `the policy` (YMD 2026 6 10) `a loss to an item not repaired after an earlier loss`

