§§ `General Condition 8 — fraud, and three months after an award`

#ASSERT     `General Condition 8 — all benefit under the Policy is forfeited` `a fraudulent claim history`
#ASSERT     `General Condition 8 — all benefit under the Policy is forfeited` `a history with a false declaration`
#ASSERT     `General Condition 8 — all benefit under the Policy is forfeited` `a history with fraudulent means`
#ASSERT NOT `General Condition 8 — all benefit under the Policy is forfeited` `a clean claim history`
#ASSERT `the last day to commence proceedings after an award made on` (YMD 2026 9 30) EQUALS YMD 2026 12 30
