#ASSERT `Section II Condition 2 — the payment that discharges Bao Minh of the occurrence` 5_000_000_000 1_000_000_000 NOTHING EQUALS 4_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Section II Condition 2 — the payment that discharges Bao Minh of the occurrence` 5_000_000_000 1_000_000_000 (JUST 2_500_000_000) EQUALS 2_500_000_000
#ASSERT `Section II Condition 2 — the payment that discharges Bao Minh of the occurrence` 5_000_000_000 1_000_000_000 (JUST 4_500_000_000) EQUALS 4_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Section II Condition 2 — Bao Minh's further liability for the occurrence after it pays` 2_500_000_000 EQUALS 0

-- Condition 1: an admission without consent is a breach, and defeats the claim.
#TRACE `Section II Condition 1 — the Insured's undertaking` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Insured` DOES `make an admission, offer, promise or payment without Bao Minh's written consent` AT 3
#TRACE `Section II Condition 1 — Bao Minh's option to take over the claim` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Bao Minh` DOES `take over and conduct the defence or settlement of the claim in the Insured's name` AT 5
#ASSERT `Section II — the outcome of the claim` `the policy` `proper conduct of the risk` `a third-party claim after an admission without consent` EQUALS `nothing is payable, because` `General Condition 1 — a condition precedent to liability is not met`

